"The ridge bandits are five army deserters led by a scarred former sergeant, Kang Wei."
"They camp in a charcoal burner's ruined hut in a ravine off the ridge's north side."
"They carry two old spears, a crossbow with six bolts, and knives; none has any cultivation."
"They rob but rarely kill, fearing the cultivator patrols they hear of would come for murder."
"Kang Wei's youngest man, Little Sun, is sixteen and wants only to go home."
